# Charged ollie, heelflip (J + right) right after the pop: the flip finishes and the combo lands.
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
tap flip+right 96
run 300
expect event trickEnd{trick=Heelflip} within 120..160
expect event comboLanded{name=Heelflip,points=100} within 160..240
expect no event bail
